# A small, curated snapshot of the *actual* describing triples for the
# specific external vocabulary terms tests/data/problem/valid/
# HealthDataset-shacl-full.yaml references -- fetched and checked directly
# against each term's own real source on 2026-08-25, not assumed or
# invented. Loaded into test_dataset_conforms_to_real_healthdcat_ap_shacl's
# validation call (merged into the data graph) so pyshacl's skos:inScheme /
# sh:class checks have the real membership triples to check against,
# instead of failing simply because the bare term reference in our own
# instance data carries no local proof of it.
#
# Deliberately a static, checked-in snapshot, not a live fetch during test
# runs: this project already has direct, confirmed evidence that w3id.org's
# own permalink redirects are intermittently flaky (see
# docs/architecture-verification.md), and a live network dependency inside
# a test that's supposed to be a fast, deterministic regression check is
# the same class of risk, just against a different host. Refresh by
# re-running the curl commands in this file's own git history / commit
# message if the referenced terms are ever expected to have changed.
#
# NOT every external term in the fixture has an entry here: checked
# directly (curl, both without and with explicit turtle/RDF-XML Accept
# headers) and confirmed empty -- dataset-type/EXPLOITABLE from the EU
# Publications Office, and all three of HealthDCAT-AP's own
# "acceptance"-environment vocabularies (healthcategories/ONCOLOGY,
# health-theme/CANCER, coding-system/ICD_O_3) currently return a
# genuinely empty RDF document (<rdf:RDF></rdf:RDF>, no content at all) at
# their own real URI -- not fake terms, but nothing real to load either.
# Likely explained by HealthDCAT-AP's vocabulary server still being a
# pre-production "acceptance" environment. Revisit once/if that changes.

@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix dpv: <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
@prefix pd: <https://w3id.org/dpv/pd#> .

# --- EU Publications Office authority-table terms (confirmed real, populated) ---

<http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/HEAL>
    a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Health"@en .

<http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/NON_PUBLIC>
    a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right> ;
    skos:prefLabel "non-public"@en .

<http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL>
    a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency> ;
    skos:prefLabel "annual"@en .

<http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG>
    a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language> ;
    skos:prefLabel "English"@en .

# --- DPV (Data Privacy Vocabulary) terms (confirmed real via dpv.ttl / pd.ttl) ---

dpv:LegalObligation
    a skos:Concept, dpv:LegalBasis .

dpv:ScientificResearch
    a skos:Concept, dpv:Purpose .

pd:MedicalHealth
    a skos:Concept, dpv:PersonalData, dpv:SpecialCategoryPersonalData .
